        "t_20": "<section class=\"PageContent\">\n<div class=\"Rectangle2\" data-layer=\"Rectangle 2\"></div>\n<div class=\"Intro\" data-i18n=\"t_8\" data-layer=\"Intro\">SETTING</div>\n<div class=\"Page1-TheEntangledBody\" data-i18n=\"t_9\" data-layer=\"The Entangled Body\">The Entangled Body</div>\n<img class=\"Art7\" src=\"Artboard 7.png\"/>\n<img class=\"Art30\" src=\"Artboard 30.png\"/>\n<img class=\"Art31\" src=\"Artboard 31.png\"/>\n</section>\n<section class=\"Content1\">\n<div class=\"Introduce\" data-i18n=\"t_10\" data-layer=\"INTRODUCE\">RULES</div>\n<div class=\"Body\" data-i18n=\"t_12\" id=\"IntroBody1\">\n                - In this project, you cannot turn back\u2014you can only move forward. Experience the project all the way to\n                its end to feel and understand more deeply.<br/>\n                - You will experience either healing the body or continuing to sabotage it through bad habits, thereby\n                drawing personal lessons.</div>\n<div class=\"Rectangle3\" data-layer=\"Rectangle 3\"></div>\n<div class=\"Next\" data-i18n=\"t_13\" data-layer=\"NEXT\">NEXT</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"Content2\">\n<div class=\"Introduce\" data-i18n=\"t_14\" data-layer=\"INTRODUCE\">INTRODUCE</div>\n<div class=\"Body\" data-i18n=\"t_15\" id=\"IntroBody2\"> Unhealthy habits built over years can severely damage interconnected body\n                systems\u2014from the heart and lungs to blood sugar and circulation\u2014creating a complex web of chronic\n                conditions. When a patient reaches this critical state, doctors cannot operate immediately, as even the\n                slightest intervention could be life-threatening.</div>\n<div class=\"Rectangle3\" data-layer=\"Rectangle 3\"></div>\n<div class=\"Next\" data-i18n=\"t_16\" data-layer=\"NEXT\">NEXT</div>\n</section>\n<div class=\"chossenpage\">\n<div class=\"ChooseATopicToExplore\" data-i18n=\"t_17\" data-layer=\"choose a topic to explore\">choose a topic to explore</div>\n<div class=\"BeerRect\" data-layer=\"Rectangle 3\"></div>\n<div class=\"Beer\" data-i18n=\"t_18\" data-layer=\"beer\">beer</div>\n<div class=\"SmokingRect\" data-layer=\"Rectangle 3\"></div>\n<div class=\"Smoking\" data-i18n=\"t_19\" data-layer=\"Smoking\">Smoking</div>\n</div>\n SMOKING PAGE \n<section class=\"Smoking1\">\n<div class=\"Introduce\" data-layer=\"INTRODUCE\"> SMOKING</div>\n<div class=\"Body\" id=\"Smokbody1\">\n                - Smoking is one of the main harms that damage the lungs. Toxic smoke accumulates over many\n                years, leading to a large tumor at the top of the chest, and even causing the two lungs to\n                harden like a torn sponge, distorting the main blood vessels and forcing the weak heart to endure. <br/>\n                - Currently, the body is already sick and is still getting worse, but it can still be saved. You can\n                experience it by making the illness worse or finding a way to cure it.\n            </div>\n<div class=\"Rectangle3\" data-layer=\"Rectangle 3\"></div>\n<div class=\"Next\" data-layer=\"NEXT\">START</div>\n</section>\n BEER PAGE \n<section class=\"Beer1\">\n<div class=\"Introduce\" data-layer=\"INTRODUCE\"> BEER</div>\n<div class=\"Body\" id=\"Beerbody1\">\n                - Drinking alcohol and beer for many years in an uncontrolled manner not only creates a lumpy tumor in\n                the\n                liver but also turns the entire liver organ into a hard pebble, causing blood to pool and swell in the\n                throat, and making the blood lose its ability to clot. <br/>\n                - Currently, the body is already sick and is still getting worse, but it can still be saved. You can\n                experience it by making the illness worse or finding a way to cure it.\n            </div>\n<div class=\"Rectangle3\" data-layer=\"Rectangle 3\"></div>\n<div class=\"Next\" data-layer=\"NEXT\">START</div>\n</section>",
